you have to start a business around  something that you are passionate about  or you're going to fail it's important  to make money and I want you to make a  lot of money and that comes from  starting the business that helps people  and is around something that you love to  do if you're only chasing the dollars  they're not gonna come I'm Evan  Carmichael your friend and all things  entrepreneurship and today I want to  answer a question from one of our  Facebook fans vixen who wrote in to say  I don't know what to do  so vixen wants to start a business thank  you for writing in I feel your pain it's  a common question I get asked and it's  it's a great question to ask because too  many entrepreneurs jump into a business  because they're trying to make a lot of  money and they end up broke and then up  tired and frustrated and wasting all  their energy going down the wrong path  on something that they thought would  help get them rich quick you got to  start a business around something that  you love to do here's how I started mine  this business of helping entrepreneurs I  just sold my company and I got asked to  do some speaking the YMCA asked me to  come and talk to their entrepreneurs say  can you help our young group of  entrepreneurs develop and share your  lessons hey this is great why not I'll  do it and I spent weeks preparing for it  and promoting it and they were promoting  it and the day came I was so excited my  heart was pumping I remember walking  into the door isn't going up to the  elevator and going into the room this  big room full of chairs and my heart  sank for a second and I took a big  swallow because after all that  preparation and all that promotion for  this free event only three people showed  up to this event  three people and it was so sad and so  disappointing because I'm so looking  forward to doing this and I continued on  because there were still three people  and the show must go on  and it was awesome it was so much fun  and I touched those three people that  day I helped them I knew they would go  home different people than when they  came you can see the looks on their  faces as we talked that now they had  renewed energy and hope and ideas of  voices that grow their business and I  knew that I had to continue doing this  even if I couldn't find a way to make a  scale I had to keep doing this this is  what I was born to do and you've got to  find that for yourself  even if it wasn't getting paid to do it  even if I couldn't find a way to make  money even if I had to go find a job to  support myself so I can keep doing this  on the side I had to find a way to keep  doing it and that's when you know you're  on the right path  there's a famous entrepreneur George  Lucas started the Star Wars franchise is  worth over four billion dollars today  and if you read his store and how he got  started he says that his first six years  in business were a failure he didn't  know what he was doing he thought about  giving up he thought about quitting he  thought about going back and getting a  real job to support himself and just  survive his friends and family thought  he was nuts but he kept going he kept  going because he felt he had to because  he loved what he was doing he had a  passion for filmmaking that you can only  understand if you had that same passion  if he didn't love what he was doing so  much he would have quit because it's too  hard but he kept at it and he's worth  over four billion dollars today so  you've got to start a business around  something that you are intensely  passionate about how do you find it my  favourite way as I started to make a  list and I made three different lists  the first list looks at things that  you're really excited about doing what  do you like to do in your day to day  life you know what do you like to do  that helps people so it's not things  like sitting on my couch and watch TV  because that's just a stress outlet you  couldn't do that all day long and be  happy with your life what do you do in  your life that makes you happy that's  your first list then you think about  things that you want to do things you  wish you could do things you wish you  could spend more time on then you write  down those ideas and in the third list  is things that have frustrated you in  the past that you've solved you found  the solution for something that was  really bugging you because it was  buggins new it's probably gonna bug  somebody else and you could probably  help them with it make those three lists  and see what jumps off that page see  what potential business opportunities  there are on there the amount of money  you're gonna make is gonna be directly  related to one how much you love what  you're doing and two how much you're  helping people so you want to look at  that list and think about how much you  love all those ideas and how much you  can use those ideas to help other people  that's the beginning of your opportunity  to find your dream business I have a  worksheet that explains all that and  then the next steps and a lot more deal  detail that you can check out on a  website but the first part really is  finding a business that you are  extremely passionate about and you love  doing that's step number one  all the business advice in the world is  not going to help you unless you've got  that part figured out so good luck  you're asking the right question vixen  you're on the right path and for anybody  in the same situation it's really worth  spending the time to figure that out  before you just jump into any  opportunity because you're probably  gonna go broke and end up frustrated and  angry if you end up into the wrong  business it's a good luck keep us posted  I want to hear about your progress for  those of you watching if you like the  video please give it a thumbs up below  it makes you want to do more for you and  I love to hear we have to think if you  want to leave a comment under the video  I love seeing those and I always  read them so thank you and I'll see you  on the next episode
 

